  <tei:text>
    <tei:body>
      <tei:div corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:prayer:ushpizin">
        <tei:p><tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:ushpizin/1"/>Enter, esteemed holy guests,
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:ushpizin/2"/>come in, esteemed holy Patriarchs,
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:ushpizin/3"/>to sit in the shade
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:ushpizin/4"/>of sublime faithfulness,
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:ushpizin/5"/>in the shade of the Holy One, blessed is He.
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:ushpizin/6"/>Enter Abraham, and with him
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:ushpizin/7"/>Isaac, Jacob, Moses,
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:ushpizin/8"/>Aaron, Joseph and David.
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:ushpizin/9"/>Behold, I am prepared and ready
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:ushpizin/10"/>to perform the mitzvah [to sit in the] <tei:hi rend="italic">sukkah,</tei:hi>
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:ushpizin/11"/>as I was commanded by the Creator,
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:ushpizin/12"/>blessed is His Name:
<tei:milestone unit="verse" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:leviticus/23/42"/>
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:ushpizin/13"/>“In <tei:hi rend="italic">sukkos</tei:hi> you shall dwell seven days;
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:ushpizin/14"/>every born Israelite
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:ushpizin/15"/>shall dwell in <tei:hi rend="italic">sukkos,</tei:hi>
<tei:milestone unit="verse" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:leviticus/23/43"/>
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:ushpizin/16"/>in order that your generations may know
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:ushpizin/17"/>that in <tei:hi rend="italic">sukkos,</tei:hi>
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:ushpizin/18"/>I caused the Children of Israel to dwell
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:ushpizin/19"/>when I took them out of the land of Egypt.”
<tei:milestone unit="phrase"/>
<tei:milestone unit="verse"/>
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:ushpizin/20"/>Be seated, be seated, esteemed guests,
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:ushpizin/21"/>be seated, be seated, holy guests,
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:ushpizin/22"/>be seated, be seated,
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:ushpizin/23"/>guests of faithfulness,
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:ushpizin/24"/>[be seated] in the shade
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:ushpizin/25"/>of the Holy One, blessed is He.
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:ushpizin/26"/>Worthy is our portion,
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:ushpizin/27"/>and worthy is the portion of Israel,
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:ushpizin/28"/>as it is written:
<tei:milestone unit="verse" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:deuteronomy/32/9"/>
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:ushpizin/29"/>“For Adonoy's portion is His people;
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:ushpizin/30"/>Jacob, the lot of His inheritance.”
<tei:milestone unit="phrase"/>
<tei:milestone unit="verse"/>
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:ushpizin/31"/>For the sake of the unity
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:ushpizin/32"/>of the Holy One, blessed is He,
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:ushpizin/33"/>and His Presence,
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:ushpizin/34"/>to unify the Name Yud-Kay with Vov-Kay
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:ushpizin/35"/>in complete unity
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:ushpizin/36"/>through Him Who is Most Hidden,
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:ushpizin/37"/>in the name of all Israel.
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:ushpizin/38"/>May the pleasantness of my Master, our God,
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:ushpizin/39"/>be upon us,
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:ushpizin/40"/>and the work of our hands establish for us;
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:ushpizin/41"/>and the work of our hands may He establish.
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:ushpizin/42"/>May it be Your will,
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:ushpizin/43"/>Adonoy, our God, and the God of our fathers,
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:ushpizin/44"/>to cause Your Presence to dwell among us;
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:ushpizin/45"/>and spread over us the shelter of Your peace
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:ushpizin/46"/>in the merit of the mitzvah of <tei:hi rend="italic">sukkah</tei:hi>
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:ushpizin/47"/>that we are performing, to unify the Name of
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:ushpizin/48"/>the Holy One, blessed is He and His Presence,
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:ushpizin/49"/>with reverence and love, to unify the Name
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:ushpizin/50"/>Yud-Kay with Vov-Kay in complete unity,
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:ushpizin/51"/>in the name of all Israel;
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:ushpizin/52"/>and to surround us
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:ushpizin/53"/>with the splendor of Your honor,
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:ushpizin/54"/>holy and pure,
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:ushpizin/55"/>spread over their [our] heads from above
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:ushpizin/56"/>as an eagle arousing its nestlings;
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:ushpizin/57"/>and from there [may there be,]
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:ushpizin/58"/>bountiful outpourings of life for Your servant
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:ushpizin/59"/>(son of),
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:ushpizin/60"/>Your handmaid.
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:ushpizin/61"/>And in the merit of my leaving my house, to go out [into the sukkah],
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:ushpizin/62"/>and the path of Your commandments,
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:ushpizin/63"/>I will eagerly follow,
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:ushpizin/64"/>may this be considered for me
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:ushpizin/65"/>as though I have wandered far off [in exile].
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:ushpizin/66"/>Cleanse me thoroughly from my iniquity,
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:ushpizin/67"/>and from my sin, purify me.
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:ushpizin/68"/>From the exalted guests,
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:ushpizin/69"/>the guests of faithfulness,
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:ushpizin/70"/>may Your ears hear
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:ushpizin/71"/>bountiful blessings.
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:ushpizin/72"/>To the hungry and thirsty,
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:ushpizin/73"/>give them their food and their water
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:ushpizin/74"/>in a reliable manner.
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:ushpizin/75"/>Grant me the privilege
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:ushpizin/76"/>to dwell and take refuge
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:ushpizin/77"/>in the sheltering shadow of Your wings—
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:ushpizin/78"/>at the time I leave this world—
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:ushpizin/79"/>to take refuge from the stream [of fire]
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:ushpizin/80"/>and from the rain [of fiery coals]
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:ushpizin/81"/>when You rain snare-traps upon the wicked.
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:ushpizin/82"/>May it be considered—
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:ushpizin/83"/>the mitzvah of sukkah that I perform—
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:ushpizin/84"/>as though I had fulfilled it
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:ushpizin/85"/>in all its particulars, exactness, specifications,
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:ushpizin/86"/>and all the mitzvos dependent on it.
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:ushpizin/87"/>May it be for our good when You seal [the judgements of Rosh Hashanah —Yom Kippur,]
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:ushpizin/88"/>and may we be privileged
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:ushpizin/89"/>to dwell many days upon the land,
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:ushpizin/90"/>the Holy Land,
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:ushpizin/91"/>in Your service and in Your reverence.
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:ushpizin/92"/>Blessed is Adonoy forever, amein and amein.
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:ushpizin/93"/>I invite to my meal
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:ushpizin/94"/>the exalted guests:
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:ushpizin/95"/>Abraham, Isaac, Jacob,
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:ushpizin/96"/>Moses, Aaron, Joseph and David.
<tei:milestone unit="phrase"/>
<tei:note type="description" xml:lang="en">On the first day say:</tei:note>
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:ushpizin/97"/>I beg of you,
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:ushpizin/98"/>Abraham, my esteemed guest,
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:ushpizin/99"/>may there be seated with me and with you—
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:ushpizin/100"/>all the other esteemed guests—
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:ushpizin/101"/>Isaac, Jacob, Moses,
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:ushpizin/102"/>Aaron, Joseph, and David.
<tei:milestone unit="phrase"/>
<tei:note type="description" xml:lang="en">On the second day say:</tei:note>
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:ushpizin/103"/>I beg of you,
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:ushpizin/104"/>Isaac, my esteemed guest,
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:ushpizin/105"/>may there be seated with me and with you—
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:ushpizin/106"/>all the other esteemed guests—
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:ushpizin/107"/>Abraham, Jacob, Moses,
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:ushpizin/108"/>Aaron, Joseph, and David.
<tei:milestone unit="phrase"/>
<tei:note type="description" xml:lang="en">On the third day say:</tei:note>
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:ushpizin/109"/>I beg of you,
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:ushpizin/110"/>Jacob, my esteemed guest,
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:ushpizin/111"/>may there be seated with me and with you—
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:ushpizin/112"/>all the other esteemed guests—
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:ushpizin/113"/>Abraham, Isaac, Moses,
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:ushpizin/114"/>Aaron, Joseph, and David.
<tei:milestone unit="phrase"/>
<tei:note type="description" xml:lang="en">On the fourth day say:</tei:note>
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:ushpizin/115"/>I beg of you,
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:ushpizin/116"/>Moses, my esteemed guest,
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:ushpizin/117"/>may there be seated with me and with you—
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:ushpizin/118"/>all the other esteemed guests—
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:ushpizin/119"/>Abraham, Isaac, Jacob,
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:ushpizin/120"/>Aaron, Joseph and David.
<tei:milestone unit="phrase"/>
<tei:note type="description" xml:lang="en">On the fifth day say:</tei:note>
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:ushpizin/121"/>I beg of you,
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:ushpizin/122"/>Aaron, my esteemed guest,
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:ushpizin/123"/>may there be seated with me and with you—
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:ushpizin/124"/>all the other esteemed guests—
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:ushpizin/125"/>Abraham, Isaac, Jacob,
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:ushpizin/126"/>Moses, Joseph and David.
<tei:milestone unit="phrase"/>
<tei:note type="description" xml:lang="en">On the sixth day say:</tei:note>
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:ushpizin/127"/>I beg of you,
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:ushpizin/128"/>Joseph, my esteemed guest,
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:ushpizin/129"/>may there be seated with me and with you—
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:ushpizin/130"/>all the other esteemed guests—
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:ushpizin/131"/>Abraham, Isaac, Jacob,
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:ushpizin/132"/>Moses, Aaron and David.
<tei:milestone unit="phrase"/>
<tei:note type="description" xml:lang="en">On the seventh day say:</tei:note>
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:ushpizin/133"/>I beg of you,
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:ushpizin/134"/>David, my esteemed guest,
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:ushpizin/135"/>may there be seated with me and with you—
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:ushpizin/136"/>all the other esteemed guests—
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:ushpizin/137"/>Abraham, Isaac, Jacob,
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:ushpizin/138"/>Moses, Aaron and Joseph.
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:ushpizin/139"/>Master of all the worlds,
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:ushpizin/140"/>may it be Your will
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:ushpizin/141"/>to consider before You—
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:ushpizin/142"/>this mitzvah of sitting in the sukkah
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:ushpizin/143"/>as though I had fulfilled it
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:ushpizin/144"/>in all of its particulars and exactness,
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:ushpizin/145"/>and the six hundred thirteen mitzvos
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:ushpizin/146"/>dependent on it;
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:ushpizin/147"/>as though I had in mind
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:ushpizin/148"/>all the intended purposes
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:ushpizin/149"/>that were intended therein
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:ushpizin/150"/>by the Men of the Great Assembly.</tei:p>
      </tei:div>
    </tei:body>
  </tei:text>
</tei:TEI>